    "text_full": "Skip to content\nAbout Us\nPrograms\nNews & Media\nDONATE\nFR\nHERITAGE MINUTES\nPODCASTS\nVIDEOS\nEDUCATION GUIDES\nSEARCH PRODUCTIONS\nAbout Us\nCareers\nBoard of Directors\nStaff\nSupporters\nPolicies\nContact\nHome\n / About Us / Careers\nCareers\n\nIf you are hard-working, collaborative, highly skilled and passionate about Canadian history, citizenship and identity, you will find yourself among like-minded people at Historica Canada.\n\nPlease note that the website application will include general yes/no questions related to the role that are required, but your answers to those questions will not disqualify your candidature.\n\nCurrent Openings\n0 of 0 items displayed\n0 items\n\nHistorica Canada is a charitable organization that offers programs in both official languages that you can use to explore, learn, reflect on our history, and consider what it means to be Canadian.\n\nHistorica Canada's business number is 885434720RR0001\n\nAbout Us\nPolicies\nCareers\nHistorica Canada Content Usage Request Form\n\nFollow Us\nMore From Historica Canada\nCitizenship Challenge\nHeritage Minutes\nThe Memory Project\nThe Canadian Encyclopedia\nPartnership: The World Remembers\n© Historica Canada 2026. All rights reserved.\nWebsite by DS"
